hy\":\"Rung 1 holds because Nvidia completed the acquisition on or before the due day.\"}\n{\"scenario\":17,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"Rung 2 holds because both companies confirmed abandonment of the acquisition as a whole.\"}\n{\"scenario\":18,\"rung\":3,\"why\":\"Rung 3 holds because the deal has not closed and the suit remains in court.\"}\n{\"scenario\":19,\"rung\":2,\"why\":\"Rung 2 holds because a decision against the acquisition as a whole stands while the appeal is pending.\"}\n{\"scenario\":20,\"rung\":3,\"why\":\"Rung 3 holds because the deal has not closed and the closing date was moved later.\"}"}}
